h  faster and even ian's elbow which does a  lot of renders for front page tech and  his own renders he himself said that  even the m1 ultra max studio did not  have enough gpu performance for him for  his renders he's waiting for the mac pro  so in reality i don't think anybody  doing blender or any kind of 3d  rendering is going to be looking at the  macbook air so with that said the final  conclusion is this  no i do not think that anybody should be  buying the 10 core gpu model i don't  think it's worth the small improvements  that you are getting so with that said  everybody looking at the m2 macbook air  should just be sticking to the eight  core save the 100  put it somewhere else maybe put it  towards an ssd upgrade or more ram do  not spend the 100  extra so  there you go hopefully you enjoyed this  video and if you learned something new  then comment down below because it's  going to enter you into the giveaway  don't forget that and be sure to  subscribe as well which is another  requirement so check out one of those  two videos right there thanks for  watching and we'll see you in the next  video  [Music]
 

